    <!-- Disclosures & Permissions -->
    <string name="dialog_disclosure_title">Location &amp; Trip Logging Notice</string>
    <string name="dialog_disclosure_message">Travel Access collects location data to enable:

• Automated driving trip logging and route tracking
• Accurate vehicle mileage calculation for business and personal expense reports
• Hands-free trip detection when connected to vehicle Bluetooth

Location data is collected while the app is active and continues in the background (even when the app is closed, not in use, or the screen is off) while a driving trip is ongoing.

Your location data is stored securely on your device and sent only to your configured private server. It is never sold, shared with third parties, or used for advertising.</string>
    <string name="dialog_disclosure_agree">Agree &amp; Continue</string>
    <string name="dialog_disclosure_refuse">No Thanks</string>
    <string name="dialog_disclosure_refuse_status">Location permissions required for automated trip recording.</string>
    <string name="dialog_bg_location_title">Background Location Permission</string>
    <string name="dialog_bg_location_message">To automatically detect trips when connected to vehicle Bluetooth and record complete GPS routes while the screen is off, Travel Access requires background location access.

On the next screen, please select "Allow all the time" to ensure continuous trip logging.</string>
